    "description": "Bottom navigation label for the Decks destination. Kept separate from decksTitle even though the English words match: a tab label is competing for width with another label and may need to be shortened in a language where the screen title cannot be."
  },
  "navigationStudyLabel": "Study",
  "@navigationStudyLabel": {
    "description": "Bottom navigation label for the Study destination, where the user studies due cards. Kept separate from a screen title for the same reason as decksTitle: a tab label competes for width and may need shortening where a title does not."
  },
  "decksTitle": "Decks",
